{"version":1,"key":"card:460","content":{"id":460,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"zip()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 函数可以将多个可迭代对象中对应位置的元素打包成一个元组，然后返回一个这些元素构成的迭代器","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4847251b-e33c-4f07-81a4-8b3a72b947aa","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"fruits = ['apple', 'banana', 'cherry']\ncolors = ['red', 'yellow', 'purple']\n\nfor fruit, color in zip(fruits, colors):\n    print(fruit, color)","collabId":"3a963862-0e35-4c66-94e1-b0601548c1bc","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"2c81b375-a5af-4594-9e70-8224ea64f60b","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"0f1ff108-7e4b-4d68-b38b-3577d4d16351"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"apple red\nbanana yellow\ncherry purple","collabId":"598eb1f6-f3a1-4c5c-b88b-c678b869175f","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"6f7d6596-7be9-41e1-a77d-562e5575a540","language":"py","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f41ce53f-266e-4b6e-a3d0-c07914e5d027"},{"children":[{"text":"当传递给 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"zip()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的可迭代对象长度不同时，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"zip()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 会以最短的长度作为返回结果的长度","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e7261c58-57b3-4f7d-a3ab-90624c0b643c","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"keys = ['a', 'b', 'c']\nvalues = [1, 2]\n\nd = dict(zip(keys, values))","collabId":"0d69aad2-9722-4dd1-8d53-2707e804d5af","tauContract":"01b01a